Package: genmediation
Title: Genetic Mediation Analysis via Longitudinal SEM
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("M.", "Shahisavandi", email = "m.shahisavandi@erasmusmc.nl",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits structural equation models (SEM) to estimate genetic
    mediation of polygenic risk scores (PRS) on child outcomes through
    longitudinal parental specific trait. The package wraps lavaan-based models
    for PRS with bootstrap inference and provides helpers for
    data preparation, model fitting, and result extraction.
